<title>ISRAEL: Netanyahu says additional budget cut needed.</title>
<headline>Netanyahu says additional budget cut needed.</headline>
<dateline>CAESAREA, Israel 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israeli Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu said on Monday another budget cut was needed in addition to the seven billion shekels reduction already made this year.</p>
<p>&quot;The thing that must be done immediately is another fiscal cut. There is no escaping this,&quot; he told a major Israeli economic conference.</p>
<p>Netanyahu did not specify the size of the cut he wants to make.</p>
<p>&quot;There is a limit to how much we can cut the budget,&quot; he said.</p>
</text>
